## Real auth folder layout

The auth feature is a single flat folder — do **not** split it into `lib/src/login/`, `lib/src/otp_verification/`, or `lib/src/create_account/`.

```
lib/src/auth/
  signin_page.dart
  signup_page.dart
  verify_page.dart
  forget_password_page.dart
  reset_password_page.dart
  use_forget_password_page.dart
  change_email_page.dart
  change_phone_page.dart
```

No `components/` subfolder currently exists for auth. Add one if shared auth UI pieces emerge.

## Providers

Auth state is split across two provider files:

| File | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `lib/data/providers/authentication_provider.dart` | Persisted session (`AuthenticationModel`), `isSignedIn()`, `logout()` |
| `lib/data/providers/auth_provider.dart` | Auth actions — login, register, verify, forgetPassword, changeEmail, changePhone etc. Calls `authClientProvider` directly (no repository in the auth domain). |

## Routes

Use typed route classes from [`lib/router/app_router.dart`](lib/router/app_router.dart) (codegen in `lib/router/routes/app_routes.dart`). Navigate with `SomeRoute().go(context)` or `ref.read(routerProvider).go(const SomeRoute().location)`.

| Screen | Typed route |
|---|---|
| Sign in | `SignInRoute` (`/sign-in`) |
| Sign up | *add `SignupRoute` when the page exists* |
| OTP / verify | *add `VerifyRoute` when the page exists* |
| Forget password | *add typed route when the page exists* |
| Reset password | *add typed route when the page exists* |
| Use forget password | *add typed route when the page exists* |
| Change email | *add typed route when the page exists* |
| Change phone | *add typed route when the page exists* |

## Theme tokens for auth UI
Do not name auth-specific tokens `loginOtp…` or `signIn…`. Use flow-agnostic names (e.g. `authInputStyle`, `verifySubtitleColor`) in `lib/theme/app_theme.dart`.
